<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites 18,000 tonne maize tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites 18,000 tonne maize tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Wednesday invited tenders for the supply of 18,000 tonnes of maize, with shipment in March 1997.</p>
<p>Tenders close on February 25, the commission said in a statement.</p>
</text>
